OL,3,ARescuers dig through debris as seven
OL,4,Adead in building collapse in Delhi
OL,5,
OL,6,FRescuers are digging through the rubble
OL,7,Fa day after a residential building
OL,8,Fcollapsed in the Indian capital, Delhi,
OL,9,Fkilling at least seven people.
OL,11,FIt's not clear how many people were
OL,12,Finside the five-storey building in
OL,13,Fsouth-west Delhi - or if there are
OL,14,Fstill people under the debris.
OL,16,FEyewitnesses told local media on Sunday
OL,17,Fthat two-to-four dozen people were
OL,18,Finside, but no official numbers have
OL,19,Fbeen shared. Authorities have confirmed
OL,20,F12 people were taken to hospital and
OL,21,Fthat seven died while others are
OL,22,Freceiving treatment.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
