OL,3,ARescuers dig through debris as seven
OL,4,Adead in building collapse in Delhi
OL,5,
OL,6,FDelhi Chief Minister Rekha Gupta said
OL,7,F"accumulation of water, combined with
OL,8,Fongoing repair work in the basement" of
OL,9,Fthe building, Hostel Daze, caused the
OL,10,Fcollapse.
